    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>The M-55 Argus is a battle rifle that fires three-round bursts with enough force to stagger heavily armored targets. Alliance R&amp;D designed it to bridge the gap between the Avenger's volume of fire and the Mattock's raw stopping power. Its burst pattern keeps shots tightly grouped at medium range, and the combination of mass and velocity makes each cluster capable of punching through armor that individual rounds would merely dent.</p>"
